q-120367"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-26706"] :question/problem "Find the exact value of $1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}).$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={67.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {67.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{135}^{∘} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-332150/field-1/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" :answer/id #uuid "f6cd7bcb-3de1-541c-bb53-94df1808b15f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332150/field-1/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "b2e4e5ee-8f2a-5b25-9c4a-69ddbde50454" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332150/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ce2ecf3a-4132-54d3-bf34-3e4322776b8a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-332150/field-1/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" :answer-field/choices ["q-332150/field-1/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" "q-332150/field-1/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-332150" :question/id #uuid "ba3ee242-53d3-59bb-9592-b216b9936095" :question/math-academy-id "q-332150" :question/problem "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that our expression is a perfect square that can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}) & ={({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}))}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}) & =cos\\,(2\\cdot \\frac{7\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =cos\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}))}^{2} & ={(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})}^{2}=\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-332150/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2902b205-4508-55c6-9a68-f57d3afc9eab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-332150"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-120370/selection/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744" :answer/id #uuid "41cf8136-8583-5c85-923c-013100a22878" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120370/selection/e7f6c27482797e11bd6b0013338edc6789517ab47eb94f4fe9912fc5f8b6c4b8" :answer/id #uuid "c332b390-19af-59d0-9331-1327e944654b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120370/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "2dc0b2e5-a987-5f9f-8445-7d3eabafac8e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120370/selection/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" :answer/id #uuid "174a7923-257b-5ad2-ac2b-1ba97410d7f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120370/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "09246832-74f9-58c4-9d86-17557d4d52c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120370/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a307b299-5428-5e41-bdfc-b161fbbb5a32" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-120370/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer-field/choices ["q-120370/selection/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744" "q-120370/selection/e7f6c27482797e11bd6b0013338edc6789517ab47eb94f4fe9912fc5f8b6c4b8" "q-120370/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-120370/selection/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" "q-120370/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-120370" :question/id #uuid "bf6ceb46-c6fb-5788-bf6d-5e6b00180228" :question/math-academy-id "q-120370" :question/problem "Find the exact value of ${cos}^{2}⁡({157.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({157.5}^{∘}).$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={157.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡({157.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({157.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {157.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{315}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-120370/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2902b205-4508-55c6-9a68-f57d3afc9eab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-120370"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-3666"] :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={\\dfrac{\\pi}{24}}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24})-{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{24}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{24}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-3667"] :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n2 \\cos^2 x - 1 = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-1 & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-3668"] :question/problem "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of $\\cos^2\\left( 22.5^\\circ\\right) - \\sin^2\\left( 22.5^\\circ\\right).$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x = \\cos 2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={22.5^\\circ}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({22.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {22.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
